&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 245.13333333333333333333333333px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;0.15%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 26.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 245.13333333333333333333333333px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;取締役&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 245.13333333333333333333333333px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;0.12%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 96px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;b.　業績達成支給乗率&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 120px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;業績達成支給乗率=連結売上高達成率×50%+連結営業利益達成率×50%&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 120px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;・連結売上高達成率&lt;/p&gt;
